  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Md. Code Ann., Public Safety § 5-307): A permit is valid for each handgun legally in the possession of the person to whom the permit is issued.\nSection 1 (Md. Code Ann., Public Safety § 5-307(b), struck by the bill in [brackets]): [(b) The Secretary may limit the geographic area, circumstances, or times of the day, week, month, or year in which a permit is effective.]"
